mportant;\">\n          Maruyama 日本东京\n         </strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpgUUfQmRWqW6JfWNqKicmYiaQqC8xbzzUxy1XEyVQ2TcGEgVUySVkM3vg/0?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width: 322px;height: 322px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Guatemala\n           <strong>\n            Huehuetenago\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             El Injerto\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Pacamara\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n           Kenya\n           <strong>\n            Thika\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Gitwe FCS Karinga\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n            </span>\n</em>\n           AA Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n           Kenya\n           <strong>\n            Thika\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Gitwe FCS Karinga\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n            </span>\n</em>\n           AB Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n           Ethioipa\n           <strong>\n            Gedeo Gedeb Sakaro\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Ato Mijane\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Heirloom\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n         这周上丸山老师的杯测与烘焙课程，今天第一天，深深地被老师的花一般的笑容折服，风趣，认真耐心，字字珠玑，笔记密密麻麻的记了很多，还没来得及整理，先把豆子放上来；课上也有机会杯测了六只不同的肯尼亚，其中就两只来自Thika的Karinga处理厂的AA和AB批次，希望店头出品能冲的出它应有的水准，finger crossed!\n        </p>\n<p>\n         不过这四支里我最期待的还是茵赫特的帕克玛拉，没办法，我就钟情于它，2015年，第一次有机会踏上危地马拉产区时，也是我人生第一次参与CoE赛事，整整一周印象最深的就是帕卡玛拉，从第一次矫正的极度不适应，讨厌，无法拿捏这个品种风味的打分，无法欣赏到后面一轮轮的被桌上的不同庄园的帕卡玛拉所矫正，到最后，来自茵赫特的帕克玛拉获得了当年的第一名；随后也是有生以来第一次线上竞拍，激动的拍到了一个帕卡玛拉批次，从此它便成为我的偏爱。\n        </p>\n<p>\n         不多说了，来喝便是了，如果我在店里，请容许我当面把上面的文字再添油加醋的给你描述一番！\n        </p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Onibus 日本东京\n         </strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpVKia5Om8KlhcAVPe4P8LGyINOiapN0gy605m4sV7BXc5QMPFHvBptDqw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 306px;height: 306px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Colombia\n           <strong>\n            Huila Palestina\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Alfredo Baos Finca Sinai\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Caturra\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n<p>\n           这是今年最喜欢的哥伦比亚产区和庄园，非常的莓果，第一次闻到喝到这样的哥伦比亚有点错愕，感觉是不是有人拿一个很棒的肯尼亚跟你开玩笑，但它确实是哥伦比亚，不信你来试试看撒。\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Mojo Coffee 台中\n         </strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n99gBcic1YWANFD9DLiaRC6BQsv9THBjrWODZ4Hj9Sm1aPGKsjMP7LrRPGOR9sLcnn8COkwic498TKUg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 282px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            Ethiopia BG Selection \"Lion King\"\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<em>\n              Heirloom\n             </em>\n</span>\n            Natural\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            狮子王，看到这个名字现在就想笑，曾经我差点给小狮子起了这个大名，“我的中文名叫王子狮，英文名较Shizi WANG （此处升调）” 哈哈\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           跑偏了，这只豆子怎么说，特别棒！\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            Ethiopia Guji Suke Quto\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<em>\n              Heirloom\n             </em>\n</span>\n            Washed\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            Costa Rica BG Selection \"Beethoven\"\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<em>\n              Caturra\n             </em>\n</span>\n            Honey\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            Costa Rica BG Selection \"Mozart\"  哈哈 最后这批成为乃大专供了\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            Costa Rica Tobosi Copey\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<em>\n              Gesha\n             </em>\n</span>\n<em>\n</em>\n            Washed 燕子说她现在能抓到这只豆子最佳的出品期了\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n            Honduras La Paz San Jose\n            <em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n              Catuai\n             </span>\n</em>\n            Washed\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Indonesia Sumatra Ache Sc#18 Mandhleing\n           <em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Typica Mutation\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Wet-hulled\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         洪都拉斯与印尼都是中深烘焙，喜欢这个口的朋友可以都试一下，特别推荐洪都拉斯，嘿嘿\n        </p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 16px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Square Mile 英国伦敦\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4niciag5Q6azucSNNPRlUL1QGbLoVcCtMyCBUWsXfcic5b4sk6hiaLa2U7veEYWBibvTtYL1CCZNoKsVe6A/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         现在店里有，\n        </p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Costa Rica\n           <strong>\n            Tarrazu\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Ortiz 1900\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Catuai\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           四姐妹共同运营家族的处理站，各自经营自己的农场，Ortiz 1900是大姐的庄园。\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n            Kenya\n            <strong>\n             Embu\n            </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n              Nyawira Estate\n             </strong>\n</span>\n            AA\n            <em>\n             SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n            </em>\n            Washed 售罄\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n            一个小农庄园，成立于1987年\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Ritual - 美国旧金山\n         </strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4nicA8tMsaHEjHggNcSh1TUdm6I7eIU2FXlKcK90FB5jfO9p9wDSicF2IZeTNYXTaqFWyE96aOFVdpwg/0?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"background-color: rgb(238, 237, 235);border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(238, 237, 235);background-size: 22px;background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat;height: 179px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 394px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           El Salvador\n           <strong>\n            Sonsonate\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Nancy Majano de Arenivar Finca Monte Rey\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Bourbon/Pacas\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Monte Ray是RITUAL从2008年便开始采购的庄园\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Costa Rica\n           <strong>\n            Tarrazu Santa María de Dota\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Farami de Dota\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Bourbon\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Honey\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Colombia\n           <strong>\n            Huila Palmar de Criollo\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             El Guamo\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Caturra\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            George Howell 美国波士顿\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4niciag5Q6azucSNNPRlUL1QGbGficH4UJqmRUD5BcEjkztNMjNMp235KHPFf232v6wwRRpEQZNSxczng/0?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n           Ethiopia\n           <strong>\n            Gedeo\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Yirgacheffe Chelchele\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Heirloom\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n           Guatemala\n           <strong>\n            San Martin\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             La\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Concepcion Buena Vista\n            </strong>\n</span>\n           Bourbon Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n           Costa Rica\n           <strong>\n            T\n           </strong>\n<strong>\n            arrazu\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             La Minita El Zapote\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Caturra\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         本月测试豆，不做售卖，仅测试用途，如果你碰巧赶上的话 嘎嘎嘎\n        </p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           George Howell Continental Blend\n          </p>\n<p>\n           风味描述是 焦糖 caramel，黑巧克力 dark chocolate，核桃 walnut\n          </p>\n<p>\n           三个我非常期待的风味，也特别想做出这样的配方给客人，学习！\n          </p>\n<p>\n           这个配方是GH选择了两款深烘焙的哥斯达黎加塔拉珠做的拼配组合\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         本月刮来一阵澳洲大豆风，由衷的感谢辛苦人肉回来的昆逸伙伴，把列表上的店一个不漏的跑了个遍，厂牌与豆子信息如下，慢慢耐心的看哈，\n        </p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Sample 澳洲悉尼\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpkUsUjAlic8jkwo29pu64nnB6J16H4hRXUAcTeWGxRIjCv2WYeF5Xwpw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Honduras\n           <strong>\n            Santa Barbara\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Genesis\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Parainema/Pacas\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed COE#19\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n           Houduras\n           <strong>\n            Sata Barbara\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Miraflores\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Parainema\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n<p>\n           第二次喝来自圣芭芭拉产区的豆子，两个都含有抗病品种Parainema，期待会是怎样的风味。\n          </p>\n<p>\n           之前做过一些理解洪都拉斯CoE的统计，大部分得奖的庄园批次种植品种都是卡杜艾Catuai，另外还有像是Maracaturra， Bourbon, Typica单一品种或者混种的，去年还有一个卡蒂姆Catimor家族的IHCAFE 90。\n          </p>\n<p>\n           BTW，Sample是我个人最喜欢的澳洲的咖啡馆。\n          </p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Single Origin 澳洲悉尼\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXp6SCe3kBLMLsHUjepQzmLjmzyZzGSD78uiboderiacDm22U9kjKkmI1bQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           El Salvador\n           <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Las Mercedes\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);text-decoration: none;\">\n             Bourbon/Pacamara\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Mecca 澳洲悉尼\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpiaHtehjjLqBrCevtZKN2TafG0ITyNPJGLLJZ62oWJmjXMFBUVOZdafw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Rwanda\n           <strong>\n            Huye\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Maraba Cooperative Kabuye\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Bourbon\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            The Reformatory Caffeine Lab 澳洲悉尼\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpBUoXklVJeeTchC2EAya1OH29nmQfX5P4Sgn2C5YLticxbqAlwfn4tOw/0?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Nicaragua\n           <strong>\n            Nueva Segovia\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Jalapa\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Bourbon\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n<p>\n           这个厂牌我第一次见，包装特别酷\n          </p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpY16fKSTiaO8ZlibS8pCLE65snbtbQnVBn2ZFZRDTSNxQwMxFdStzz9Fw/0?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width: 248px;height: 397px;\"/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Edition 澳洲悉尼\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpOFrZ2UxTXw146cxeqSgeicX5rbd2Q8mmFKndYqEkOlRwHM27icwPB56w/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Honduras\n           <strong>\n            Santa Barbara\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             El Dorado\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             IHCAFE 90\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Natural\n          </p>\n<p>\n           洪都拉斯的咖啡研究中心研发的卡蒂姆系列，代号IHCAFE 90，16年洪都拉斯CoE国内预算赛第二名就是一只IHCAFE 90。\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);\">\n          Dukes 澳洲墨尔本\n         </strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpiac74QKRTwQ0vDPT5TUeUuvBzHwDdTm3RuLMgOibMZQYldYphxx5Aucg/0?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width: 404px;height: 64px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Costa Rica\n           <strong>\n            Central Valley\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Sonora\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Caturra\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Natural\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Small Batch 澳洲墨尔本\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpf3sDsWDwRkMwz5RSmwuEtBuveC1KtZibd5V7fnzJVIicSMiamLC5Da5cA/0?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Kenya\n           <strong style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n            Kirinyaga\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Rungeto FCS Kiangoi\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Proud Mary 澳洲墨尔本\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpAlsP7kKymPb4glm0MMF4Y5TQjvickUXZGUIhMdZ1T5pKSQ3b5qZz4Rg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 146px;height: 140px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Honduras\n           <strong>\n            Santa Barbara\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             El Cielito\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"color:#ff4c41;\">\n<em>\n             IHCAFE 90\n            </em>\n</span>\n           Washed\n          </p>\n<p>\n           有一个圣芭芭拉产区的，不过这个是卡蒂姆，感觉可以组一局了\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Supreme 澳洲墨尔本\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpWpMTnLfnSGTMqtZP0fM5pcEoWoX9IW55jpxcBnufWgK8sU1IeAPQfg/0?wx_fmt=gif\" style=\"width: 273px;height: 313px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Ethiopia\n           <strong>\n            Oromia\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Adola\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Heirloom\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n         这个厂牌以后要花点时间去翻一些资料，之前去墨尔本没做好功课，遗憾只能留待下次去弥补了。\n        </p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Assembly 澳洲墨尔本\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXpuoicslfwbmajGTtOqdRDzFRYfkZUdcWnYbtFdibJN4y5yCdGzmHczDBA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 245px;height: 269px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Ethiopia\n           <span style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n<strong>\n             Gedeo Yirgacheffe\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Konga Cooperative\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Heirloom\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Seven Seeds 澳洲墨尔本\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXp9y8emcqj4DKxCaIvXwYdovicMIuYvRUqWnf1d6ic29gosZXmxFib0Ay3A/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 362px;height: 193px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Guatemala\n           <strong>\n            Huehuetenango\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Rosma\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             Bourbon/Catuai/Villa Sarchi\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ab1942;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n<strong>\n            Market Lane 澳洲墨尔本\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9GcMShQibdNxeJbJIF85TXp1icgezggpmiawIh1icYbulu4slxxV13P0iczX0WJvzDtB2Lyw8iaEwSeSFw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 328px;height: 328px;\"/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n           Kenya\n           <strong>\n            Embu\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Thambana FCS Kiungu\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n             SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Washed\n           <br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
